{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/n10' data-title='10'>\r\n\t\t\t10\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"NoInteractiveServices can show a service on the parallel session screen, but it cannot take input.","label":"Interactive service","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/guest_account","label":"Guest account","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/guest_account"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/personalize","label":"Personalize","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/personalize"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA system service can be made to display on the parallel session screen via:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>HKLM\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Windows\nNoInteractiveServices : 1<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIt cannot receive any input. Even Ctrl+Alt+Del will not work. It automatically leads to the login screen after some time, about 1 minute.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-s